   "start": 680.16,
   "end": 687.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "If you enjoyed this episode, please like and subscribe. And if you wanna see other content from Team Four Star, check out their gaming channel."
  },
  {
