   "start": 707.34,
   "end": 720.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Oh, they have a patreon too! Donate there to support the team! And, um, uh Shark Robot! Uh, shirts! I helped make a shirt commercial once ya know. I'm, ah-ha, kind of a voice actor..."
