   "line_end": 152
  },
  {
   "start": 533.0,
   "end": 547.74,
   "title": "HOLY... SHIT!",
   "quote": "HOLY... — ...SHIT! — I kinda liked the old arm better. Oh well. I'll just have to brrreak it in!",
